// Port of shadcn's app-sidebar.tsx.
//
// DEVIATION: our <Sidebar> registry part has no `variant`/`collapsible`
// props (see ui/sidebar/sidebar.marko) — source passes
// variant="inset" collapsible="offcanvas". "offcanvas" is this part's only
// behavior already; "inset" cannot be expressed (see page.marko's notes).
//
// Icons: tabler-icons SVGs are reproduced as raw inner-markup strings
// (mixed <rect>/<circle>/<path> children, so a single `d` string like
// sidebar-07/nav-main.marko uses isn't enough) and rendered through the
// `svgIcon` helper below with $!{} — a `<const>` cannot hold a multi-line
// tag expression directly (Marko's parser rejects a JSX-shaped value
// spanning lines inside `<const/x=() => <svg>...`).
